menu "Kiosk application"

    config APP_CONSOLE
        bool "Provisioning console on the USB port"
        default n
        help
            Serves nvs get and nvs set over USB so wifi and broker settings
            reach NVS without any file holding a secret (KEHOACH 6.2.1).
            Off here and on in sdkconfig.dev and sdkconfig.bench: a prod image
            compiles none of it, because a runtime flag would live in the very
            NVS the console can write and could re-enable itself.

endmenu
